 "www.nationsreportcard.gov"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"47e587818e033382\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n2022 MATHEMATICS STATE SNAPSHOT REPORT NATION  GRADE 8  PUBLIC SCHOOLS\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"47e587818e033382\">>>", "url": "https://nces.ed.gov/nationsreportcard/subject/publications/stt2022/pdf/2023011NP8.pdf", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7e04b6be169153f2\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nNAEP ACHIEVEMENT-LEVEL PERCENTAGES AND AVERAGE SCORE\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7e04b6be169153f2\">>>", "siteName": "nces.ed.gov"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ff54648f6a17b9ea\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nNAEP State and District Snapshots\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ff54648f6a17b9ea\">>>", "url": "https://nces.ed.gov/nationsreportcard/snapshots/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d8d853a00388f9d1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nExplore and download state and district snapshots of NAEP data in mathematics, reading, science, and writing.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d8d853a00388f9d1\">>>", "published": "October 10, 2025", "siteName": "nces.ed.gov"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"441433034fce6f4c\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nNAEP Mathematics: Mathematics Highlights 2022\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"441433034fce6f4c\">>>", "url": "https://www.nationsreportcard.gov/highlights/mathematics/2022/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"884b75b53e554c63\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThis Report Card Highlights contains key findings from the 2022 mathematics assessment. See the NAEP Mathematics Report Card to explore the full set of student performance results and information about students’ learning experiences inside and outside of school.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"884b75b53e554c63\">>>", "siteName": "www.nationsreportcard.gov"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1776057710708}}
